- [ ] `<head>` 含 `<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">`
- [ ] 媒体查询断点**只用** 768 / 480
- [ ] `.kpi-grid` 有 `≤768 → 2 列` + `≤480 → 1 列` 降级
- [ ] 所有 `<table>` 外层包 `<div class="table-wrap">`
